gametitle=Twisted Metal: Black Online (NTSC-U) (SCUS-97196) [TMB-Reloaded test patches]

[Pedestrians online v2]
author=TMB-Reloaded
description=Two fixes. (1) InitAfterDbLoad clears the PedWorldManager enabled flag (+0xB944) unconditionally: NOP the store. (2) The level loader (dbProcInteractive, func_00127650) skips pedestrian nodes (ids 3000-3999) instead of calling addPedEpNode: branch them to a stub (in unused func_00111ED8) that calls addPedEpNode(node). Peds are NOT network-synced.
