[Traffic online (no effect yet)]
author=TMB-Reloaded
description=Removes InitializeFodderCars' player-count checks. Has no visible effect on its own: online's level loader drops traffic-car nodes (ids 1025-2999) and FodderParse was removed from the online build. Needs FodderParse ported from retail (decomp work).
